[{"type":"message","user":"U027BQYM708","text":"\u003c@U027BQYM708\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1625050580.308100","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"aaf7d413-7ed2-479f-8b54-102218439350","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"`read` べんり","ts":"1625020997.307600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Dh1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f38f8781-2248-4aeb-b930-d7574939f5a8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なる","ts":"1625020964.307300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wEz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b8fd724-f41c-4320-96c0-16f31851c9b1","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あ、その前に `read`を実行しているので正常に動作します","ts":"1625020907.307100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sY7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb76fc04-8c0c-4d66-9ee8-4ce9a6fc6a30","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"こうしないとだめかもしれない\n```docker exec -it mysql_host bash -c  \"mysql -udocker -pdocker -e \\\"create database \\${DB_NAME:-laravel};\\\"```","ts":"1625020889.306600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QgOQy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"423e05cb-a82d-484a-b5c5-3481d58a065b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; docker exec -it mysql_host bash -c  “mysql -udocker -pdocker -e \\“create database ${DB_NAME:-laravel};\\”\nこれ、期待した動作にならないような気が","ts":"1625020854.305800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vXrB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23835e10-8038-4eee-b5c0-c9a0204bf255","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"めちゃくちゃ思わぬ最適化された","ts":"1625020502.304500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":2,"users":["UPWFF5YQ7","UDDCM376D"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EFh3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35df3a29-0359-45ec-a720-54deae2cdd82","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"お、docker-composeの環境変数を修正したことで、自動的にDBが作成されて権限も `ALL PRIVILEGES`が適応されてるから\n```docker exec -it mysql_host bash -c \"mysql -uroot -proot -e \\\"grant all on *.* to docker;\\\"\"\ndocker exec -it mysql_host bash -c  \"mysql -udocker -pdocker -e \\\"create database ${DB_NAME:-laravel};\\\"```\nのくだりが必要なくなった","ts":"1625020490.304200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+u8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6001dd3f-e49f-4074-a681-36cc9057d686","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"あ、なるほどです。失礼しました。\nそういえば同一コンテナ内の話で進んでましたもんね。","ts":"1625020428.303300","thread_ts":"1625020355.300900","subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"panda_dogeza","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n/8"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"06aed161-2d89-4a11-902b-bc74c8e977c9","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、すません ping は \u003chttps://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/5.6/ja/mysql-ping.html|https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/5.6/ja/mysql-ping.html\u003e この意味で書いてました","ts":"1625020355.300900","thread_ts":"1625020355.300900","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OiSMZ"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"53b9d35a-b793-43f1-98c3-6973f1fe6866","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"wait-for-it も同じようなことができると思います","ts":"1625020417.302800","edited":{"user":"UDDCM376D","ts":"1625020422.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NJ/18"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9138e1b-85d8-4952-8344-0004910c4c9c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"待ちをするなら dockerize が便利ですね","ts":"1625020395.302200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EdF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b4e0633-32a8-4e51-9680-42424a64ae68","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://docs.docker.jp/compose/startup-order.html\u003e","ts":"1625020380.301600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qb=v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2bdb76ec-c37c-41d5-83d5-066187120317","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vishnubob/wait-for-it\u003e\nこういうのもありますね","ts":"1625020363.301200","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"vishnubob/wait-for-it","id":1,"title":"vishnubob/wait-for-it","text":"Pure bash script to test and wait on the availability of a TCP host and port","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"6666","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Python","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W+QPv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b145a7c5-6611-48eb-8320-81da0e6544af","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"初期化処理でSQLからファイルを書き出して、そのファイルを待つ、、のはちょっと大げさですかね。","ts":"1625020355.301000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TQZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06aed161-2d89-4a11-902b-bc74c8e977c9","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、すません ping は \u003chttps://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/5.6/ja/mysql-ping.html|https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/5.6/ja/mysql-ping.html\u003e この意味で書いてました","ts":"1625020355.300900","thread_ts":"1625020355.300900","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OiSMZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccd2e935-0751-43fb-a925-297fae12cd0b","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"厳密にいうとプロセスの起動確認ですね。\nコンテナの起動確認（ネットワーク疎通の確認）は ping でできるかも。","ts":"1625020342.300400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F8L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0348286-7bcc-423d-a132-024639069f81","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"一応ですが ping で起動確認はできないはず（レイヤが違うのでポートという概念がない）\n\n一応 nc でポートの待受確認ができます。\n\n私は mariadb or mysql のコンテナに繋ぐときは、接続元コンテナの entrypoint に以下みたいな処理挟んで実処理前に mariadb の起動待機させてます。\n```        while ! nc -z db 3306 ; do\n            echo \"waiting for ready the DB connection ... $((++cnt))\"\n            sleep 1\n        done```","ts":"1625020274.299200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"98K8k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8fd52e5-79ce-4bc3-bcc7-3afdd27825fc","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"まぁでも問題が解決したなら全部 :yoshi: ! ですね!","ts":"1625020060.297200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yoshi","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jdh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e76678e-7ab5-4668-b0fe-00de8d5543b0","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あとなんで設定変えずで 2回目はつながるんだろ?","ts":"1625020022.296200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2+v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b803d442-7266-4fc8-9789-b4642bfded47","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"権限で弾かれたときも can't connect のエラーでるんだっけ...","ts":"1625019965.294800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ook+A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d6c7ac3-15a5-4b91-8bf0-a151debbd878","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"docker-compose で立ててるなら自動生成された network につながってて、そこで container_name による名前解決ができるので MYSQL_HOST 指定でも繋がると思ったんだけどな","ts":"1625019930.293800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IctE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc5f9c99-e734-48d6-be65-a50001f3c691","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"かもしれないです","ts":"1625019812.289800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TK9Gf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bfeeab86-9df1-4290-99dd-78d962a8f5cb","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"んで、cliが MYSQL_HOST を見て、 mysql_host に接続しようとしてつながらないってなるってやつか","ts":"1625019804.289400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gut"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3c7cb49-8db8-4f2a-ac27-faff0bf49388","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、繋ぎに行く先という情報か","ts":"1625019756.287500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MFH8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64c62677-4874-47bc-948f-27b4fac0982b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ただ、それを自分がまちがえてdbコンテナにつけてしまっていることが原因ぽいです\n本来Laravelのコンテナにつけなければいけない","ts":"1625019734.287200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dgmvP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"abef7010-18cd-4ff6-b250-f154c96bf3e0","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"えっと、まず `MYSQL_HOST: mysql_host` は、laravelの `.env` ファイルの値よりもdocker-composeで指定した値のほうが優先されるのでつけています","ts":"1625019696.286400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AFQhl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59b5566f-5d63-487e-9918-4d54decf3395","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あ、そういうことか","ts":"1625019636.285000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kanzenrikai","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tW1g"}]},{"type":"message","user":"USLACKBOT","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.org/slacklog/files/F01V0AAC0TE/image.png\u003e","ts":"1625019596.284200","attachments":[{"fallback":"1024x803px image","id":1,"image_url":"https://vim-jp.org/slacklog/files/F01V0AAC0TE/image.png","blocks":null,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.org/slacklog/files/F01V0AAC0TE/image.png","original_url":"https://vim-jp.org/slacklog/files/F01V0AAC0TE/image.png"}],"subtype":"slackbot_response","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"7790c509-8d8a-4941-9ba1-957d0e0aaae1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"!ペンギン","ts":"1625019596.284100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aEc4Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"764db3fa-a547-48bb-b419-7f9ed5e45b82","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"まず、 `docker-compose exec mysql_host bash \"mysql -uroot -proot -e \\\"grant all on *.* to docker;\\\"\"` だと正常に動作しました","ts":"1625019531.282300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":2,"users":["U06BRP8VD","UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rqd5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57cc295b-8913-49e5-b593-cf9fc895a1ac","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ええと、とりあえず状況整理させてください","ts":"1625019456.280500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mLTn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0925bd0-208a-40f4-abd0-ef095a33fcae","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ペンギンすいません","ts":"1625019451.280300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+fT5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c71297ac-ec99-4206-aa75-5cc4ffffbe4b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ペンギンしてきた","ts":"1625019438.279800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rHL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8cee2b63-d5db-414a-8512-f2cc41bb5c3f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"bash は必要ないと思います","ts":"1625019425.279300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nrs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2af8d55f-d0e3-46a4-969b-d8c0369a004f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"たしかに。複文じゃないのでそのままでよさそう。","ts":"1625019423.279200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FL0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e012979e-21e8-44a2-b873-e3082a984f48","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"mysql のcliって、MYSQL_HOSTって環境変数を見て接続先を決めているんで、その環境変数を消せば 0.0.0.0:3306 で接続してくれるはず\n```docker exec -it mysql_host mysql -uroot -proot -e \"grant all on *.* to docker;\"```","ts":"1625019417.278900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+bS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33e9c839-5283-47f3-9554-4a7c7d73dcb4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"っ僕はそこにbash挟む必要があるのかはわからない。","ts":"1625019401.278300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4fQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"333f1fc2-fea7-47d4-958e-40f915ece10e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`docker-compose exec db bash -c 'mysql -uroot -proot -e \"hoge\"'` かな","ts":"1625019358.276800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SWzl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f333b3db-fe38-406a-aaa7-2cb34621ed4b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`docker-compose` 使う場合は基本的に `docker-compose` のコマンドだけ使って `docker` コマンドは使わなくていいはず","ts":"1625019342.276200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U06BRP8VD","U06ECBRTJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1CYd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72db5ced-cf34-4cf4-8044-babad473cb22","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"一応 docker psとかで名前見ればよい","ts":"1625019323.275400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x38"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3d683ce-0696-4912-8d1e-76f6a104dc57","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"というか、 `-c` は bash の引数なので、`docker-compose exec` とは直接関係ないですよ","ts":"1625019314.274900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ay63w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d239d675-c932-43ee-bb43-b2978f4afd14","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003c@U01AQ5BFNLX\u003e `MYSQL_HOST: mysql_host` を消したらどうなりますか？","ts":"1625019313.274800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q8YaI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2bdb209a-d242-41f6-a85a-bddb9224a480","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そもそも container_name を指定したいシーンってほぼほぼないはずなんだけど、なんで必要なんだろう","ts":"1625019291.273800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2sVn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc714104-df9d-43af-8c9c-18e413b0c827","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"これ消せば良さそうな気がしてきた","ts":"1625019287.273600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ybkE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5767b88a-d9c9-4476-acf4-f8c7cab46731","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```MYSQL_HOST: mysql_host```\n","ts":"1625019280.273100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uXY/h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20e4e471-f58b-4759-b200-601062812c58","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー","ts":"1625019279.272900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w/3Qn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e435345d-d0a5-45e4-a3b2-d0d535e2f756","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど","ts":"1625019268.272400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gona"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe6f87b0-c7c5-4480-8206-107bd3317e30","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"-cはいらないんじゃなかろか","ts":"1625019259.272100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hYrt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d012dc92-7465-454b-8d39-e4688547cba3","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u0026gt; `MYSQL_HOST: mysql_host`\n普通っぽいって書いたけど、この環境変数設定初めて見た\nというか、意味あるのかな…？","ts":"1625019254.271900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"owgu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4624973e-5aae-48ca-bdfc-c25c29a4d949","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"渡せるよ。っていうか docker compose exec -h で確認して。","ts":"1625019249.271700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gs="}]},{"client_msg_id":"3195009d-1360-4347-bd0d-7a7795da7b7f","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"docker-compose execを使った場合も  `-c`でコマンド渡せるんですかね?","ts":"1625019230.271100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o7iOs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6216aa64-6b93-4a0c-8e27-e92ce82d0a96","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"docker compose execはそれを補ってくれるけども。","ts":"1625019229.271000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hmV2i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"030a4106-f78a-438e-ae9d-8a0e4682be51","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"MySQLがdocker composeで起動してるなら実際のコンテナ名にはそのディレクトリの名前がついてる。","ts":"1625019213.270500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZjVs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45467741-3a11-4c5e-93c7-193284422d1f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"docker exec じゃなくて docker compose exec 使っても同じ?","ts":"1625019184.269000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ya2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57523d9f-ae84-4