-1658351d68db","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"遅くなりました。docker-compose.ymlです","ts":"1625018289.256100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a9eR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad94790c-799c-40ea-9f04-56d790e095b4","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"```  db:\n    image: mysql:8.0\n    container_name: mysql_host\n    environment:\n      MYSQL_HOST: mysql_host\n      MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD: root\n      MYSQL_USER: docker\n      MYSQL_PASSWORD: docker\n      TZ: 'Asia/Tokyo'\n    command: mysqld --character-set-server=utf8mb4 --collation-server=utf8mb4_unicode_ci\n    volumes:\n        - ./docker/db/data:/var/lib/mysql\n        - ./docker/db/my.cnf:/etc/mysql/conf.d/my.cnf\n        - ./docker/db/sql:/docker-entrypoint-initdb.d\n    ports:\n      - 4306:3306```","ts":"1625018275.255800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dy="}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e387046-5773-4cd9-a9b0-e64d622040b4","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"まあでも raa さんの言うとおり、初期化ならお作法にしたがうのが楽ですね\nユーザー/DB作成なら環境変数でもできますし","ts":"1625017772.254300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H6A1="}]},{"client_msg_id":"723f342c-968c-4f63-8fc3-5e6910179873","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"スクリプトのなかで、ping 投げて起動確認すりゃよさそ","ts":"1625017656.252300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KLJo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f435323-ba77-48cd-9631-6265abd3712c","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"シンプルに sleep 30 が足りてなかっただけすかね","ts":"1625017618.251400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CBF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10bd2030-502d-4d46-8508-2ac8811dc6ee","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"そうですね","ts":"1625017596.250700","team":"T03C4RC8V