 のログを見てみるといいと思います","ts":"1625015215.221300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PnHy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9df89f0a-538c-482d-87c9-a93b327495cc","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"最大で30secです","ts":"1625015208.220800","edited":{"user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","ts":"1625015214.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wb8="}]},{"client_msg_id":"4901547b-5fdc-429c-b758-bf94ec59b1be","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"sleep はどれくらい入れました?","ts":"1625015176.220100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ckA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee9087e7-229b-440c-9599-efdc156fd38b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"質問です。現在以下のようなスクリプトを動かすと `ERROR 2003 (HY000): Can't connect to MySQL server on '{container_name}:3306' (111)` が出てしまいます。\n```docker-compose up -d\n\ndocker exec -it mysql_host bash -c \"mysql -uroot -proot -e \\\"grant all on *.* to docker;\\\"\"```\ndockerが起動しきれていないのではと思い、 `sleep`を追加してみましたが変化なしでした。\n初回実行時にエラーがでて、2回目以降は正常に動作します。\nこの場合なにが考えられるでしょうか?","ts":"1625014338.219700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4k8r"}]}]
